<h1>About Pokédex Explorer</h1>

<p>
Pokédex Explorer is a Ruby on Rails 8 web application built for a web development course.
</p>

<h2>Features</h2>

<ul>
  <li>Browse all Pokémon</li>
  <li>Search Pokémon</li>
  <li>Browse by Type</li>
  <li>Browse by Region</li>
  <li>View Pokémon details</li>
</ul>

<h2>Database</h2>

<p>
This application uses SQLite and Active Record.
</p>

<h2>Data Source</h2>

<p>
Pokémon information was imported from the public
PokeAPI using a custom Rails seed file.
</p>